### Register User
POST http://localhost:4000/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:4000/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### Test Wrong Password
POST http://localhost:4000/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

